ust about","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_12","text":"to apologize to the Commander for slapping them in the face before.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_13","text":"But your sudden appearance and strange words interrupted me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_14","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_14","text":"My face still feels numb.","jump":"m_mainafter_02_01_16"},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_15","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_15","text":"Never mind. I deserved it.","jump":"m_mainafter_02_01_22"},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_16","text":"I saw it! You slapped with your weight.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_17","text":"What are you taking abo","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_18","text":"What are you talking about?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_19","text":"Hahaha!","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_20","text":"Is that your apology?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_21","text":"Oh, geez.","jump":"m_mainafter_02_01_28"},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_22","text":"That's true.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_23","text":"The most common cause of Nikkes' death","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_24","text":"is poor command. At least, that's what I've heard.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_25","text":"Of course, I've no doubt that Master will overcome it right away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_26","text":"So I didn't move. But I didn't expect that Anis couldn't help herself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_27","text":"Hey, mind your words.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_28","text":"Is Rapi okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_29","text":"Mm-hmm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_30","text":"I think she's fine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_31","text":"I also had several similar experiences.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_32","text":"Of being slapped in the face?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_33","text":"Don't mention that again, okay?","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_34","text":"Stay where you are.","jump":null},{"id":"m_mainafter_02_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_mainafter_02_01_